{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/tuikit\/listandtable"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"TUIkit provides two components for displaying collections of data:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"List","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": A vertical collection of arbitrary view content with selection support"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Table"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": A columnar data display with headers and configurable column widths"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Both components share the same keyboard navigation and selection infrastructure, providing a consistent user experience."}]},{"text":"List","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"List"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"List","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" displays a vertical collection of items inside a bordered container. It supports:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Optional title in the border","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Optional footer section"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Single or multi-selection"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Keyboard navigation"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Automatic scrolling with viewport management","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"text":"Basic Usage","level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Basic-Usage"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["struct ContentView: View {","    @State var selectedID: String?","    ","    let items = [\"Apple\", \"Banana\", \"Cherry\", \"Date\", \"Elderberry\"]","    ","    var body: some View {","        List(\"Fruits\", selection: $selectedID) {","            ForEach(items, id: \\.self) { item in","                Text(item)","            }","        }","    }","}"]},{"text":"With Footer","level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"With-Footer"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add action buttons or status text in a footer section:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["List(\"Tasks\", selection: $selectedTask) {","    ForEach(tasks) { task in","        Text(task.title)","    }","} footer: {","    ButtonRow {","        Button(\"Add\") { addTask() }","        Button(\"Remove\") { removeTask() }","    }","}"]},{"text":"Multi-Selection","level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Multi-Selection"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Set"},{"type":"text","text":" binding for multi-selection mode:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["@State var selectedIDs: Set<String> = []","","List(\"Files\", selection: $selectedIDs) {","    ForEach(files) { file in","        HStack {","            Text(file.icon)","            Text(file.name)","        }","    }","}"]},{"text":"Visual States","level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Visual-States"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"List rows display different visual states:"}]},{"rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"State","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Appearance"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Focused + Selected","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pulsing accent background"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Focused only"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","